<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Coca-Cola Enterprises cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Coca-Cola Enterprises cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robinson-Humphreys said on Wednesday it had cut its short-term rating for Coca-Cola Enterprises Inc to sell from market perform.</p>
<p>-- The firm said it had kept the company's long-term rating of buy.  The short-term reduction was prompted by the share price.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares opened up 1/2 to 55-3/8 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
